## 3. PowerShell Equivalents (URL Download + Silent Install)

```powershell
# MSI from URL
Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "[https://example.com/installer.msi](https://example.com/installer.msi)" -OutFile "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.msi"
Start-Process msiexec.exe -ArgumentList '/i "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.msi" /qn /norestart' -Wait
Remove-Item "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.msi" -Force

# EXE from URL
Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "[https://example.com/installer.exe](https://example.com/installer.exe)" -OutFile "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.exe"
Start-Process "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.exe" -ArgumentList "/S" -Wait
Remove-Item "C:\Windows\Temp\installer.exe" -Force
```
